# adaptive-agent-runtime — docker-compose environment template (T29).
#
# Copy to .env and fill in real values before ./scripts/smoke.sh or
# `docker compose up`:
#   cp .env.example .env
# NEVER commit the real .env (it is gitignored); this template carries
# placeholders only.

# --- required ---------------------------------------------------------------
# X-API-Key guarding /tasks/** on the REST/SSE ingress (runtime.api-key).
RUNTIME_API_KEY=change-me-smoke-key
# Postgres password for the compose postgres service and the app datasource.
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=change-me-pg

# --- Postgres connection (defaults match the compose network) ---------------
POSTGRES_DB=adaptive
POSTGRES_USER=adaptive

# --- model wiring -----------------------------------------------------------
# Smoke default: HERMETIC fixture model — the `fixture-model` Spring profile
# registers a deterministic FixedTextChatModel (same answer every call, zero
# network). Workload search tools are fixture-backed unless WORKLOAD_LIVE=1.
SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=fixture-model

# Real-model run: comment out SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=fixture-model above and
# point the app at any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, e.g. your proxy
# (SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE= stays empty) or the local `ollama` compose profile:
#   SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=
#   SPRING_AI_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key
#   SPRING_AI_OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://ollama:11434
# SPRING_AI_OPENAI_API_KEY=
# SPRING_AI_OPENAI_BASE_URL=
# Optional: pin a different (e.g. cheaper) model for the LLM complexity-classifier
# leg; leave blank to use the global default model everywhere.
# RUNTIME_CLASSIFIER_MODEL=

# --- MCP client federation (outbound) ----------------------------------------
# The external MCP server list is YAML-only (lists don't fit env vars): see the
# commented spring.ai.mcp.client block in app/src/main/resources/application.yml
# (streamable-http / sse / stdio connections). Nothing to set here — left as a
# pointer so nobody hunts for an env var that does not exist.

# --- Skills folder (optional) -------------------------------------------------
# RUNTIME_SKILLS_PATH=./skills
# Folder (as seen by the app process) with skill packages: <folder>/<name>/SKILL.md
# — frontmatter name:/description: plus a markdown instruction body. When set, all
# topologies gain the model tools list_skills / load_skill. Scanned once at startup;
# malformed or duplicate skills fail the boot. Absent: no skills, no behavior change.
# With compose: also uncomment RUNTIME_SKILLS_PATH (/app/skills) and the ./skills
# volume mount in compose.yaml.

# --- Jev (TypeSafe AI) classification leg -------------------------------------
# Optional: route the AMBIGUOUS band through the TypeSafe AI decision model
# instead of the chat-model classifier leg. Set the leg to jev and provide a
# TypeSafe AI key (runtime.classifier.jev.api-key). Default leg stays llm.
# RUNTIME_CLASSIFIER_LEG=jev
# RUNTIME_CLASSIFIER_JEV_API_KEY=

# --- tracing (micrometer OTLP → jaeger) --------------------------------------
# Container-network default; override only for host-side receivers.
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://jaeger:4318/v1/traces
